{"id":"2206a687b3a6dd80","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-zfc-ordinal8-eta-number.md","title":"ZFC Ordinal8 Eta Number","display":"df-zfc-ordinal8-eta-number — ZFC Ordinal8 Eta Number","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-ordinal8-eta-number","aliases":["58-df-zfc-ordinal8-eta-number"],"display":"df-zfc-ordinal8-eta-number — ZFC Ordinal8 Eta Number","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-epsilon-number.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-order-type.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-ordinal8-eta-number"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-ordinal8-eta-number</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-ordinal8-eta-number — ZFC Ordinal8 Eta Number"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f94e751407f5eb66\" href=\"?note=f94e751407f5eb66\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-zfc-epsilon-number.md\">../batch14/58-df-zfc-epsilon-number.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5d2cd56a38a81b7a\" href=\"?note=5d2cd56a38a81b7a\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-order-type.md\">../batch11/58-df-order-type.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma,E,Z\\in V\">\\(\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma,E,Z\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span> (ordinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EpsilonNumber}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{EpsilonNumber}_S\\)</span> (epsilon-number predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"f94e751407f5eb66\" href=\"?note=f94e751407f5eb66\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-zfc-epsilon-number.md\">../batch14/58-df-zfc-epsilon-number.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OrderType}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{OrderType}_S\\)</span> (order-type predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5d2cd56a38a81b7a\" href=\"?note=5d2cd56a38a81b7a\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-order-type.md\">../batch11/58-df-order-type.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZetaEnumFixed}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8EtaNumber}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{ZetaEnumFixed}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8EtaNumber}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span> (auxiliary zeta-fixed-point predicate and eta-number predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ordinal8\\text{-}zeta\\text{-}enumeration\\text{-}fixed}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZetaEnumFixed}_S(\\beta)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\beta)\\land\\mathrm{EpsilonNumber}_S(\\beta)\\land\\exists E\\;\\Bigl(E=\\{\\gamma\\in\\beta:\\mathrm{EpsilonNumber}_S(\\gamma)\\}\\land\\mathrm{OrderType}_S(\\beta,E,\\in\\upharpoonright E)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ordinal8\\text{-}zeta\\text{-}enumeration\\text{-}fixed}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZetaEnumFixed}_S(\\beta)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\beta)\\land\\mathrm{EpsilonNumber}_S(\\beta)\\land\\exists E\\;\\Bigl(E=\\{\\gamma\\in\\beta:\\mathrm{EpsilonNumber}_S(\\gamma)\\}\\land\\mathrm{OrderType}_S(\\beta,E,\\in\\upharpoonright E)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ordinal8\\text{-}eta\\text{-}number} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8EtaNumber}_S(\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{ZetaEnumFixed}_S(\\alpha)\\land\\exists Z\\;\\Bigl(Z=\\{\\beta\\in\\alpha:\\mathrm{ZetaEnumFixed}_S(\\beta)\\}\\land\\mathrm{OrderType}_S(\\alpha,Z,\\in\\upharpoonright Z)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ordinal8\\text{-}eta\\text{-}number} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8EtaNumber}_S(\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{ZetaEnumFixed}_S(\\alpha)\\land\\exists Z\\;\\Bigl(Z=\\{\\beta\\in\\alpha:\\mathrm{ZetaEnumFixed}_S(\\beta)\\}\\land\\mathrm{OrderType}_S(\\alpha,Z,\\in\\upharpoonright Z)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZetaEnumFixed}_S(\\beta)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZetaEnumFixed}_S(\\beta)\\)</span> says that the epsilon numbers below <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\">\\(\\beta\\)</span> have order type <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\">\\(\\beta\\)</span>, equivalently <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon_\\beta=\\beta\">\\(\\varepsilon_\\beta=\\beta\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The main predicate repeats this enumeration-by-order-type construction one level higher, equivalently expressing <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\zeta_\\alpha=\\alpha\">\\(\\zeta_\\alpha=\\alpha\\)</span> without assuming an undeclared zeta function.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Asse